---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms | Lead Strategy" description="Lead Strategy website and store terms draft.">
	<PageIntro kicker="Legal" title="Terms" lead="Website and store terms will be finalized against the approved services, products, checkout and refund policy." />
	<section class="section shell"><div class="notice"><strong>Legal review required</strong><span>This page is a launch checklist, not a substitute for final Canadian legal advice.</span></div><div class="legal-copy" style="margin-top: 50px;"><h2>Website information</h2><p>Website information is general and does not create a client relationship or guarantee a particular commercial result.</p><h2>Services</h2><p>Paid services will be governed by a written proposal or agreement that defines scope, ownership, fees, responsibilities and acceptance.</p><h2>Digital products</h2><p>Before the store opens, each product will state its price, currency, licence, delivery method, support terms and refund policy.</p><h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Lead Strategy retains rights in its site and original publications. Client and product ownership terms will be stated in the relevant agreement or licence.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions may be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@leadstrategy.ca">hello@leadstrategy.ca</a>.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
